      "message": "Hi Dai,\nThese Cls are related to Power \u0026 battery participants and corresponding changes are taken care in Coreboot too now. This is the base EC CL.\nIn this relation chain, I have used below addresses both at EC and CB.\nRelated EC CLs- 0xa6 (CL:3545778), 0xa7(CL:3545780), battery participant related addresses(CL:3639523). If it is just a single address change by you, could you please use 0xb3? or would you prefer me to change the addresses for these cLs  at EC \u0026 CB? Let me know.\n\n/* Power Participant related components */\n#define EC_MEMMAP_PWR_SRC          0xa6 /* Power source (8-bit) */  \n#define EC_MEMMAP_PWR_ARTG         0xa7 /* Adapter rating (mW) (16 bits) */\n/* Battery Participant related components */\n#define EC_MEMMAP_BATT_PMAX        0xa9 /* Maximum peak power (mW)-16 bits */\n#define EC_MEMMAP_BATT_PBSS        0xab /* Sustained peak power (mW)-16 bits */\n#define EC_MEMMAP_BATT_CMPP        0xad /* Discharge current capability \n\t\t\t\t\t   (mA)-16 bits*/\n#define EC_MEMMAP_BATT_RBHF        0xaf /* High frequency impedance\n\t\t\t\t\t   (mohm)-16 bits */\n#define EC_MEMMAP_BATT_VBNL        0xb1 /* Instantaneous No load Voltage\n\t\t\t\t\t   (mV)-16 bits */\n/* Unused 0xb3 - 0xdf */",
